{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And I will bring upon you a sword.</b> As occurred in the days of the kings of Israel, as it says: כִּי יָדַעְתִּי אֵת אֲשֶׁר תַּעֲשֶׂה לִבְנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל רָעָה, מִבְצְרֵיהֶם תְּשַׁלַּח בָּאֵשׁ וּבַחוּרֵיהֶם בַּחֶרֶב תַּהֲרֹג (II Kings 8:12)." "<b>Avenging the vengeance of the covenant.</b> Avenging with that vengeance written in the Book of the Covenant, as they said, of blessed memory (Ketubot 30a): אַף עַל פִּי שֶׁבָּטְלוּ סַנְהֶדְרִין, דִּין אַרְבַּע מִיתוֹת לֹא בָטְלוּ." "<b>And you shall be given into the hand of the enemy.</b> Like the matter of the ten tribes into the hand of the king of Assyria."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:16.983302980Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}